WEBVTT

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:35.250
What is your dream job?

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:37.550
A baseball player? A soccer player?

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:39.530
Maybe an actor?

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:42.530
<b>You can be a ninja!</b>

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:42.340
The most popular job in the 
Hidden Leaf is, of course...

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.790
Not a ninja?!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.290
I'm afraid so.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:52.200
It was always the number one 
dream job of all the Leaf kids,

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.760
but lately it hasn't been as popular.

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:57.020
What's the reason?

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:59.730
That despite of all the hard 
work required learn ninjutsu,

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:01.850
it's not a very stable career.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.720
Then what are the popular 
choices nowadays?

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:07.890
Civil service and full-time 
salaried corporate jobs.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.710
<b>Ninja</b>

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.710
Rock 
Lee

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:10.750
I guess the times are changing.

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:11.400
<b>Stability</b>

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:14.850
Lady Tsunade's very concerned,

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:18.820
and has been trying to think of ways
to spark interest in the children.

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:20.200
Here goes!

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:23.870
One, two, three.

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:26.040
You failed to hide your 
wrinkles with makeup.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.520
Lose three turns!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.250
It looks like she's worried 
about something else!

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:32.140
Have no fear!

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:37.330
If I just teach the kids it's possible to be
a first-rate ninja without ninjutsu,

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:38.730
that should change their minds!

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:41.220
I see! They might sympathize with you.

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:44.290
But how exactly should 
I make the case?

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.420
I'll go talk to Guy Sensei!

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:51.900
<i>I'm sure Guy Sensei will 
know what to say to them.</i>

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:54.360
<i>Guy Sensei!</i>

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:55.410
Guy Sensei!

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:59.280
We have ninjutsu.
That's really all we need.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:05.560
<i>We have ninjutsu.
That's really all we need.</i>

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:16.800
<b>I'll Restore the Popularity of Ninjas!</b>

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.380
He said that?

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:26.410
I'm sure he was implying that
ninjutsu is what makes us ninjas.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:29.790
I guess ninjutsu is what 
Guy Sensei really cares about.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.230
But...

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:36.460
<i>If you want to be a real ninja 
without using ninjutsu,</i>

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.890
<i>follow me and endure 
whatever hardships come!</i>

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:40.390
<i>Got it, Lee?</i>

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:41.650
<i>Yes, Guy Sensei!</i>

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.320
<i>Endure, Lee, endure!</i>

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:49.680
<i>Yes, Guy Sensei...</i>

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.460
That was your hardship?!

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.750
What have I been working so hard for?

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:55.720
Lee...

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.240
Wind Style Jutsu!

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:06.850
How troublesome...

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.250
Who wants to be a ninja now?

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:15.350
Me!

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:20.510
It's true. Naruto and the gang's 
ninjutsu are super-popular.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.560
It's not like you to be so wishy-washy.

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:28.400
That's right.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:32.330
Either give up entirely or learn some
ninjutsu, but make a choice!

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.290
Fair enough...

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.260
I'll do my best!

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:44.510
Naruto and Shikamaru are going to
assist with my ninjutsu training!

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.960
It's troublesome, but we couldn't say no.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:50.140
Don't worry, Bushy-Brows, 
we're here to help!

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.730
You could've picked a 
better demonstration...

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:57.420
I'm throbbing with excitement!

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:58.560
Trembling, trembling!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:04.490
I'll attack, you counter with ninjutsu.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:05.820
Understood.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:06.970
Here I go!

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.330
No way. You used the Replacement Jutsu?!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.580
Lee, where are you?!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.250
Over here.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.830
Where?!

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:21.540
Over here.

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:23.170
Here.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:24.960
Over here.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:27.090
That's Neji, not you!

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:28.560
Exactly!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.260
Replacement Jutsu.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:34.330
That's not a jutsu! It's just ventriloquism!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:36.060
Why is it always me...

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.850
You didn't agree to it?!

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.990
What an awesome combination!

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:41.270
Quiet, you!

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:45.960
Does my voice... sound... a little slow?

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:48.360
You're actually really good, 
but knock it off!

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:52.120
Stop with the silly gags and 
use some real ninjutsu!

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:55.030
All right, I'll have to 
use the Summoning Jutsu.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.710
You can do that?!

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.210
Summoning Jutsu!

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:01.760
That's Neji again!

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:03.130
<i>I know it's for Lee,</i>

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.160
<i>but how do I keep getting 
roped into this stuff?</i>

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:06.970
<i>Still, it's the only way.</i>

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:11.650
Bushy-Brows, when did 
you learn to summon?

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:12.140
Oh, come on.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:13.890
Round two!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.640
Break through!

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.750
<i>In this costume?</i>

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:20.160
<i>Only one way...</i>

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:24.730
Eight Trigrams Rotation!

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:27.990
It's more powerful than I thought.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:30.820
I won't hold back, either!

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:33.280
Flying Weapons, Bladestorm Riot!

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.910
I'll counter with the Rasengan!

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:38.330
Lee, you can use the Rasengan?

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.330
Naruto taught me the secret.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:46.670
You have to squeeze the chakra out of
your body into the palm of your hand.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.460
Here goes!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.890
He squeezed out his chakra!

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.600
That's not chakra!

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.480
Rasengan!

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:10.700
No, no, that's not a Rasengan at all!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.950
Hi-ya!

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.700
N-N-No!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:21.800
My eyes, my eyes!

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:24.890
What destructive force...

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:26.550
So troublesome...

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:29.010
And stinky!

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:32.370
I've got my confidence back.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:34.220
This technique is definitely the key!

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:39.180
You can't... Seriously, you can't...

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.060
What's this?

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.070
Summoning Jutsu!

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:50.550
And...

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:55.240
Rasengan!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:03.080
I did it.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:06.710
Now I'm a ninjutsu user, too!

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:08.670
Lee...

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.090
Guy Sensei!

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.940
You're trying to use ninjutsu, but why?

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:16.630
Well...

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:17.600
I overheard you.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.600
<i>We've got ninjutsu.
That's really all we need.</i>

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:25.270
So I started training 
and worked really hard!

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.270
You fool!

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:31.240
Why...

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:34.570
Lee, I don't know what tricks you used,

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.780
but you don't need half-baked ninjutsu!

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:41.340
Then what were you talking 
about with Yamato Sensei?

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:46.380
Ah, we were brainstorming ideas to make
ninjas popular with the kids again.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:53.290
<i>Ninjutsu girls.
That's really all we need.</i>

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:56.090
<b>We have
 ninjutsu.</b>

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:56.090
<b>Ninjutsu girls.</b>

00:08:56.560 --> 00:09:00.810
I wanted to start a trend with a
"Ninjutsu Girls" talent troupe.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:02.770
<i>What?</i>

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.550
What's your dream, Lee?

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:08.730
To become a first-rate ninja even
though you can't use ninjutsu.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:12.650
Right...

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.630
And developing you into such a ninja...

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.410
...is my dream!

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:20.210
Guy Sensei...

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:24.240
Guy Sensei!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:26.710
I completely misunderstood you!

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:29.040
It's okay, Lee! Don't say anything more!

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:31.100
Sensei!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.100
Lee!

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:32.630
We've got trouble!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:36.840
A bunch of ninjas from other 
villages are attacking!

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:40.100
Let's roll, Lee.

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:43.680
It's time to prove the 
worth of our ninja way!

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.640
Yes, Sensei!

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:48.230
What is that?

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.100
Dunno...

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.880
Cry, scream!

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:56.820
Hey, jerks!

00:09:56.820 --> 00:10:01.200
Don't think you can just walk outta
here after what you've done!

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:03.760
More of you...

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:05.330
Leaf ninjas!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.440
Take 'em all out!

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.370
Right!

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.540
Rasengan!

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.300
Shadow Pull Jutsu!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.010
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Strikes!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:17.220
Bladestorm Riot!

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:19.610
Let's go, too, Lee.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:20.180
Yes!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.310
Leaf Super Great Twister!

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:36.810
Cool!

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:38.120
I wanna be a ninja!

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:38.890
Me, too!

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:39.840
Me, too!

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.040
Me, too!

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:47.750
We did it, Lee.

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:50.670
Yeah!

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:52.630
Lady Tsunade,

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:56.210
I think we can trust all of 
them to fix our problem.

00:10:57.110 --> 00:10:58.670
Me, too.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:01.950
Thus, Lee and the gang 
began the formidable task...

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:04.160
...of restoring the popularity of ninjas.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.810
Of course, it goes without saying...

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:13.090
...that the debut of the "Leaf Village 48,"

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:15.750
Guy's entertainment troupe off ninjutsu girls,

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:20.640
made things with the village 
children much, much worse.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.540
When the rainy season ends,

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:36.880
a brutal summer follows!

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:40.420
Morning training's finally done.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.630
It's so hot.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:48.890
How about somen noodles 
for lunch, Guy Sensei?

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:54.730
Guy Sensei?

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:57.460
You're not very energetic today.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:01.160
I'm fine. I just missed breakfast.

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.320
That's no good!

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:06.880
If you're hungry, 
you can't eat salmon roe.

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:09.360
Plate number twenty...

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:11.820
Should I have chicken or roe?

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:13.190
I say roe!

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:15.210
Bingo!

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:16.920
The roe!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.420
Let me at it―

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:22.470
<b>Gold Plate</b>

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:22.470
<b>950 yen</b>

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:25.220
Aw, man, it's too expensive!

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:28.030
Sorry, roe, I can't afford you!

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:31.290
It's "If you're hungry,
you can’t beat your foes!"

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:34.270
And this is really "If you're broke,
you can't eat gold plate sushi!"

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:37.730
Let's have your favorite curry. 
That'll perk you up!

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:42.430
That... sounds lovely...

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:48.070
Guy Sensei...

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:50.740
Guy Sensei, snap out of it!

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:53.280
Guy Sensei!

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:03.920
<b>Death!</b>

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:05.680
He's being admitted?

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:06.630
Yes.

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:08.350
He's exhausted.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:12.350
Don't worry. It's probably 
just heat exhaustion.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.350
I see.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.920
See, even Lady Tsunade 
says he'll be okay.

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:19.670
He'll be fine after resting
for a couple of days.

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:20.910
You think?

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:22.690
Sure, it's Guy Sensei!

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:25.990
You're right!

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.240
However...

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:36.420
It's been three days and 
he still looks awful.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:40.170
Well, of course. He hasn't eaten a bite!

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:44.080
I'm not eating this watery gruel!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.630
<b>BLEH</b>

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:47.440
Men need food that packs 
a punch to get well.

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:49.820
That's such a backwards way of thinking!

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:53.140
Although you're the epitome 
of packing a punch...

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:57.960
I bet if I ate my favorite curry 
I'd make a full recovery...

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:59.440
Are you crazy?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.630
Your stomach's been weakened, too.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:05.460
Spicy food like curry will 
just make you worse!

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.300
Now, please eat!

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:09.040
She's right, Guy Sensei.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:13.040
You'll never get better if you don't eat!

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.960
Why are you eating his food?!

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:17.120
If I eat that I'll get worse...

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:21.500
Guy Sensei's condition is making 
his stubborness worse.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.320
I'll say.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:26.250
Guy Sensei, I figured you'd 
be bored stuck in here,

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:27.510
so I bought you a book.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:30.470
Oh, Lee, that's so thoughtful.

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.510
<b>Fluffy</b>

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.510
<b>Kitchen</b>

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.510
The hot-blooded man's cooking mag!

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.510
<b>It's summer<i>!!</i></b>

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.510
<b>CURRY</b>

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.930
I figured you'd like it.

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:39.450
I want curry...

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:41.080
It's making things worse!

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.900
Let's change the subject.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:47.110
Guy Sensei, get better so we can
have fun on our summer vacation!

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:49.440
How about the beach?

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.030
The beach sounds nice.

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:53.670
Hooray, Okinawa!

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:55.450
I'd like to go to the mountains.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.060
This is tough!

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:00.200
Hooray, Switzerland!

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:02.710
Yes, the mountains would be nice, too.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:06.900
And if you can't decide, 
we can go camping and enjoy them both!

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:10.260
A campfire and fireworks! 
What a great trip!

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:13.720
Kumbaya, my lord, kumbaya...

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:17.730
And of course, on a camping trip,
 you make curry for dinner!

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.140
Oh no!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.560
Lee, you idiot!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.650
That does it! Everyone out!

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:25.250
The patient can't handle 
any more trauma!

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:26.850
Sorry...

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:29.730
Lee, Lee...

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:30.530
Yes?

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:35.030
Bring me some curry, and don't 
get caught by the staff.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.820
What? I can't.

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:39.030
This is training, understand?

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:49.060
It's been so long. 
Maybe it's not just heat exhaustion.

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:50.580
What could it be?

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.260
Might Guy's the big problem.

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:55.790
We really should just cut it off.

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:58.430
But what will he want to do?

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:01.380
I don't think we should tell him.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.350
There's not much left for him...

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.370
Oh no!

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:09.880
Did you hear them?

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:12.980
The doctor said they should cut it off!

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:14.810
He must've meant surgery.

00:16:14.810 --> 00:16:17.660
And Lady Tsunade said 
there's not much left.

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:19.950
Back then...

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:24.670
<i>Bring me some curry,
and don't get caught by the staff.</i>

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:28.970
That might have been his last request!

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:30.700
It can't be!

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:31.800
Lee...

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:38.710
As Guy Sensei's pupil, I will move
heaven and earth to save him!

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:42.560
I have no choice but 
to get him his curry!

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.400
Will you two help me?

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.030
It's Shizune.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.860
Calm down. She'll get suspicious.

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:58.100
G-G-Good day, ma'am.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:00.110
We've got a package here for Might Guy.

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:01.830
Oh, go right in.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.920
<b>Curry</b>

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.460
That smell...

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:11.490
I-It's not me!

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:13.670
We're not trying to sneak in any curry!

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.860
Yes, yes, it's curry.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.220
We failed.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:20.560
<b>Clearly</b>

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:20.560
<b>Curry</b>

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.560
<b>Clearly</b>

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.560
<b>Curry</b>

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:22.270
<b>Obviously</b>

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:22.270
<b>Rice</b>

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.270
<b>Obviously</b>

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.270
<b>Rice</b>

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:29.270
Okay, it's time for a nice yummy shot!

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:31.780
Not in a million years!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.240
This is harder than I thought.

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:38.890
They've beefed up security, too.

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:41.890
I feel like a criminal.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:43.180
Criminal...

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:45.410
That's the ticket!

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:51.910
Afternoon, is this Might Guy's room?

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:54.690
Here are our badges.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:55.470
Police                             Police

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:55.590
The police?

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:59.030
Might Guy's a person of interest 
in the "Apple Killer" case.

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:01.400
We need to question him.

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:02.740
But―

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:05.330
But nothing, we're going through!

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.030
It was you, wasn't it?!

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:14.330
Stop, he's a sick man!

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:16.280
Don't be so rough on him!

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:17.460
Yes.

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:21.740
The lady's right.

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:23.040
Roake!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:26.430
Shiromedeka, there's no need to 
beat a confession out of him.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:27.960
I apologize.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:30.920
Detective Roakely, a.k.a. 
Roake the Extractor!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:33.440
I can't believe I'm going 
to see him in action!

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.460
Watch closely, Tsukkomideka!

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:41.100
Sorry, pal, these kids 
today get too worked up.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:45.780
I've got a twenty-year-old
son at home myself.

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:50.060
He's always getting into fights,
no idea who he takes after.

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:55.000
But we always talk it out over a meal.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:59.990
A good, hearty meal will 
open anyone's heart.

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:02.790
You must be hungry, huh?

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:05.360
Can't talk on an empty stomach.

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:11.580
Nurse, I'm sure he's on a restricted 
diet because of his illness,

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.840
but I want to do this quickly.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:15.710
Can you look away for a moment!

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:17.510
Uh, sure...

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:18.710
<i>Perfect!</i>

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:21.360
<i>Even Shizune can't object 
in this situation!</i>

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:22.760
<i>Now for the curry...</i>

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.720
Here, eat this!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.380
Why'd you bring katsudon?!

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.270
I got carried away with the plan!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.450
I thought katsudon fit the scene better!

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:38.320
You idiot! You brainless dunce!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.110
We're out of options.

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.860
We have to break through!

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:43.680
What're you doing?!

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:45.590
You're not getting through!

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:46.870
Fall in, everyone!

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.260
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:49.040
Freeze!

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:51.290
Curry Wave!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.040
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Strikes!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:59.050
Flying Weapons, Bladestorm Riot!

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:04.510
Go! Leave them to us!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:05.170
But―

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:07.200
Get that curry to Guy Sensei!

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.190
Y-Yes!

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:11.220
Hang on, guys...

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:12.560
I promise...

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:15.150
I will deliver the curry 
and come back for you!

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:17.820
Guy Sensei!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:21.320
I brought you some curry!

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:26.260
Who're you, sonny?

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:28.660
You're not Guy Sensei!

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:31.240
N-No...

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:35.740
Lee!

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:40.080
Oh, Mr. Might?

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.960
We discharged him this afternoon.

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:46.050
He ate a good meal and got 
better straight away.

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:50.470
He seemed happy. He ran home,
shouting about pigging out on curry.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:53.460
But I thought he didn't 
have much time left―

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:54.800
I'll explain.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.770
When you've got a mop of black hair

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:04.400
and don't wear hats, you get heatstroke.

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:07.780
So I thought we should 
give him a haircut.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.700
<i>We really should just cut it off.</i>

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:13.000
<i>But what will he want to do?</i>

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:15.470
<i>I don't think we should tell him.</i>

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:17.920
<i>There's not much left for him...</i>

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:20.460
Oh, makes sense.

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:22.170
Moving on...

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:23.610
You three.

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:29.180
You wanna spend a few days 
in the hospital, too?!

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:30.640
<b>CRASH!</b>

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:32.640
We're sorry!

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:36.830
So good.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:40.000
You three get well soon!

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:44.570
Have a safe and healthy 
summer, everyone!

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:26.760
<b>The Pool's Finally Open!
The Super Happy ♥ Orochi-Pool Park!</b>

00:23:20.400 --> 00:23:23.250
Next week is "The Pool's finally Open!"

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:25.680
and "The Super Happy Orochi-Pool Park!"

00:23:25.680 --> 00:23:27.430
Brings back bad memories...

00:23:27.430 --> 00:23:29.160
That was a bad day for you.

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:30.460
When you went back to the locker room,

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:32.470
someone had mistakenly 
taken your underwear.

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:34.860
So it was you!
